```mermaid
%% CampusLink - Flux d'Authentification (Mis à jour Avril 2025)
%% Inclut Redis Rate Limiting + Anti-Brute Force

sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 📱 Client
    participant FB as 🔥 Firebase Auth
    participant API as 🚀 NestJS API
    participant TH as ⚡ Throttler Guard
    participant SR as 🛡️ SecurityRedis
    participant AG as 🔐 AuthGuard
    participant FS as 🔧 FirebaseService
    participant PS as 🐘 PrismaService
    participant DB as 💾 PostgreSQL
    participant R as ⚡ Redis

    Note over C,DB: 🔐 LOGIN FLOW avec Protection Redis

    %% Étape 1: Authentification Firebase
    C->>FB: 📱 Authentification (OTP/Email)
    FB-->>C: ✅ JWT Token Firebase

    %% Étape 2: Requête Login avec Rate Limiting
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login<br/>Header: Bearer {token}
    
    %% Étape 3: Rate Limiting Check
    API->>TH: Check rate limit (IP)
    TH->>R: GET rate:{ip}
    R-->>TH: count = 2
    
    alt Rate limit exceeded
        TH->>R: SET block:{ip} 1 (300s)
        TH-->>API: ❌ 429 Too Many Requests
        API-->>C: { success: false, retryAfter: 300 }
    else Rate OK
        TH->>R: INCR rate:{ip} (TTL 60s)
        TH-->>API: ✅ Continue
    end

    %% Étape 4: Auth Guard
    API->>AG: Verify JWT
    AG->>FS: verifyToken(token)
    FS->>FB: validateToken()
    FB-->>FS: ✅ decoded (uid, phone)
    FS-->>AG: User decoded

    %% Étape 5: Track Login Attempt (Security)
    AG->>SR: trackLoginAttempt(ip, phone)
    SR->>R: INCR login:{ip}:{phone} (TTL 900s)
    R-->>SR: count = 3
    
    alt Too many failed attempts
        SR->>R: SET block:{ip}:{phone} 1 (900s)
        SR-->>AG: ❌ Account blocked
        AG-->>API: Throw Forbidden
        API-->>C: ❌ 403 Account temporarily locked
    end

    %% Étape 6: Database Lookup
    AG->>PS: findUser(firebase_uid)
    PS->>DB: SELECT * FROM utilisateurs
    DB-->>PS: User record
    PS-->>AG: User object

    %% Étape 7: Check Banned
    alt User banned
        AG-->>API: ❌ User banned
        API-->>C: ❌ 403 Account suspended
    end

    %% Étape 8: Reset failed attempts on success
    AG->>SR: resetAttempts(ip, phone)
    SR->>R: DEL login:{ip}:{phone}

    %% Étape 9: Attach user to request
    AG-->>API: ✅ req.user = user
    API-->>C: ✅ 200 + Token + User data

    Note over C,DB: 🔄 PASSWORD RESET FLOW

    %% Password Reset Flow
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password<br/>{ email }
    
    API->>TH: Check rate limit
    TH->>R: GET rate:forgot:{email}
    R-->>TH: count = 1
    TH->>R: INCR rate:forgot:{email}
    
    API->>PS: findUserByEmail(email)
    PS->>DB: SELECT * FROM utilisateurs
    DB-->>PS: User found
    
    API->>SR: generateResetToken(userId)
    SR->>SR: token = randomBytes(32)
    SR->>SR: hash = bcrypt(token)
    SR->>R: SET reset:{userId}:{hash} 1 (600s)
    R-->>SR: OK
    
    Note right of SR: Token envoyé par email/SMS
    
    SR-->>API: ✅ Token stored
    API-->>C: ✅ Reset link sent

    %% Reset Password
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password<br/>{ token, newPassword }
    
    API->>SR: validateResetToken(userId, token)
    SR->>R: KEYS reset:{userId}:*
    R-->>SR: [reset:{userId}:abc123]
    SR->>SR: bcrypt.compare(token, hash)
    
    alt Token invalid/expired
        SR-->>API: ❌ Invalid token
        API-->>C: ❌ 400 Token expired
    else Token valid
        SR->>R: DEL reset:{userId}:*
        SR-->>API: ✅ Valid
    end
    
    API->>PS: updatePassword(userId, newPassword)
    PS->>DB: UPDATE utilisateurs SET password
    DB-->>PS: OK
    PS-->>API: ✅ Updated
    
    API-->>C: ✅ Password reset successful

    Note over C,DB: 📝 LÉGENDE
    Note over C: Client = React/Mobile
    Note over FB: Firebase = Auth externe
    Note over R: Redis = TTL obligatoire sur toutes les clés
```
